# Files left out of the MCPB bundle (mcpb pack). The bundle carries the
# manifest, icon, pyproject.toml + uv.lock and the package source; Claude
# Desktop builds the environment with uv (server type "uv", see
# mcpb_server.py). uv.lock stays in so `uv run --frozen` pins every dependency.
